; Behaviour block: a fish that jumps out of the water (kind 13, rooms 16 and 19)
;
; Used by the magenta fish (attribute $03) that wait under the water of Lake of despair and Underground river and jump
; out of it (#R$B7C6; the lake is red). After the 5 header bytes: attribute, sprite height, width in bytes, then the
; addresses of its two sprites.
@label=BehaviourFish
b$9549 DEFB $00,$00,$07,$07,$02  ; hit box top, left, bottom, right (2-pixel units); slot +$15 (Unknown)
 $954E DEFB $03,$08,$02  ; attribute, sprite height, width (bytes)
 $9551 DEFW $EF4F    ; sprite, frame 0
 $9553 DEFW $EF51    ; sprite, frame 1
